          "start": 2.859,
          "end": 5.4,
          "en": "sometimes be very useful is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.5,
          "end": 8.34,
          "en": "self-reflective prompting. And what does",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.359,
          "end": 11.219,
          "en": "this mean? It means that you might",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.219,
          "end": 13.659,
          "en": "already have a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
