          "end": 48.819,
          "en": "could tell it to analyze its output. What's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.899,
          "end": 51.639,
          "en": "good about it, what's bad, and how could it be improved?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.419,
          "end": 55.119,
          "en": "And this is, of course, now also in the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.199,
          "end": 58,
          "en": "context window. This output is in there just as",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.059,
          "end": 60.839,
          "en": "your original prompt is still in there because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.859,
          "end": 63.659,
          "en": "it's always the entire chat history that's in the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.699,
          "end": 66.659,
          "en": "context window? And therefore, you'll now get a new",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.779,
          "end": 69.759,
          "en": "output that might be even better than the original",
